{"what":"resolve","args":["tcxp://firm.demo/rules/tax-year",null,null],"out":{"ok":"# Tax year (firm.demo)\n\nFor a US return, the tax year is the calendar year: January 1 to December 31.\nHours count toward the tax year in which they were worked, using the date of the work,\nnot the fiscal year of the project they are billed to.\n\nDemo fixture for `tcxp://firm.demo/rules/tax-year`. The virtual note `!tcxp:/firm.demo/rules/tax-year`\nis a different state on the same registry.\n"}}
{"what":"resolve","args":["tcxp://fleet.demo/env/sea-route",null,null],"out":{"ok":"# Sea route conditions (fleet.demo)\n\n| Route | Surface salinity | Freezing point |\n|---|---|---|\n| Atlantic | about 35 PSU | about 28.6 °F |\n| Baltic | about 7 PSU | about 31.3 °F |\n\nBind `$freezing_point` from the route, never from a default.\n\nDemo fixture for `tcxp://fleet.demo/env/sea-route`. The virtual note `!tcxp:/fleet.demo/env/sea-route`\nis a different state on the same registry.\n"}}
{"what":"resolve","args":["tcxp://firm.demo/env/fiscal-calendar",null,null],"out":{"ok":"# Fiscal calendar (firm.demo)\n\nThe firm's fiscal year runs from July 1 to June 30 and is named for the calendar year in which it ends.\nFY2025 runs from 2024-07-01 to 2025-06-30.\n\nDemo fixture for `tcxp://firm.demo/env/fiscal-calendar`.\n"}}
